{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/f95efe961c2bda6e930ea27ffc5ba844.poster.avif?t=1752266278\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/f95efe961c2bda6e930ea27ffc5ba844.webm?t=1752266278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/f95efe961c2bda6e930ea27ffc5ba844.mp4?t=1752266278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/d7dd94de274cb6781110067557b2130b.webp?t=1752266278\" width=616 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sundowner is a PvP survival game. Start on an island with limited resources and gather up the basic resources for survival. While you are doing that, the others on the island are doing the same, so watch out, arm yourself with whatever you have and defend yourself from the other players!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedural island generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Progression through crafting and base building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Realism-based bullet mechanics and features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Physically-based tools, body, and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play against 20 other players on official and any amount of players on community-hosted servers </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/5894a22502aa85d68199a4bb2cdec37c.avif?t=1752266278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras_big/5894a22502aa85d68199a4bb2cdec37c.avif?t=1752266278 width=800 height=462 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/303d42a3c549dabd3f8056bcff9cb2a4.avif?t=1752266278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras_big/303d42a3c549dabd3f8056bcff9cb2a4.avif?t=1752266278 width=800 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural generation can create dense forests and spawns structures that deform the terrain mesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/ac1ecdb744b7552842fda12ebbc3fbba.avif?t=1752266278\" width=304 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOD Grass Shader Optimization. Allows for performant dense grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/8011cb0409c94760659b433f2fc571b8.avif?t=1752266278\" width=645 height=957 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/ee651cceb037f21e38fd128e5d4ff6c0.avif?t=1752266278\" width=800 height=882 /></span>Loading a chamber</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/2258bf2b7f81e821bc42c03a5bd6424e.avif?t=1752266278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras_big/2258bf2b7f81e821bc42c03a5bd64