 deform the terrain mesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/ac1ecdb744b7552842fda12ebbc3fbba.avif?t=1752266278\" width=304 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOD Grass Shader Optimization. Allows for performant dense grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/8011cb0409c94760659b433f2fc571b8.avif?t=1752266278\" width=645 height=957 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/ee651cceb037f21e38fd128e5d4ff6c0.avif?t=1752266278\" width=800 height=882 /></span>Loading a chamber</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/2258bf2b7f81e821bc42c03a5bd6424e.avif?t=1752266278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras_big/2258bf2b7f81e821bc42c03a5bd6424e.avif?t=1752266278 width=800 height=375 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/662814ed856d3d9a7c2a033864b4a486.avif?t=1752266278\" width=800 height=714 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets can be seen inside the magazine and can be loaded with mixed ammunition\u00a0</p>","developers":["Eclipsed Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/header.jpg?t=1752266278","is